from native_common import *
def write():
 def read(name):
  p=O/name;return json.loads(p.read_text()) if p.exists() else None
 def block(x):return '```json\n'+json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\n```'
 def save(n,t):(O/n).write_text(t+'\n')
 done=read('evidence/EXPERIMENT_COMPLETION.json');training={m:read(f'arms/{m}/RESULT.json') for m in ['continuation','stage','candidate']};prep=read('preparation/RESULT.json');eig=read('evaluation/EIG_RESULTS.json');special=read('evaluation/SPECIALIZATION_RESULTS.json');commands=read('evaluation/COMMANDER_RESULTS.json');conditional=read('evaluation/CONDITIONAL_COMPETENCE.json');latency=read('evaluation/LATENCY.json');evaluation=read('evaluation/COMPLETION.json')
 save('TRAINING_RESULTS.md','# Training results\n\n'+block(dict(preparation=prep,native_arms=training))+'\n\nA is supervised preparation, shared once; B/C use only the native full-horizon variational information objective. The parent is trained HEC-v1 at native14001, not fresh initialization. Each completed arm receives2000 native updates,10k critic/300k posterior steps,2M new episodes/60M real observations. New parameter Adam is fresh; compatible parent states remain preserved. Missing receipts mean INCOMPLETE. No automatic retry or extension.')
 text='# Common-bank full-horizon information comparison\n\n'
 if eig:
  text+='2000 independent trajectories,1M negative contrasts plus the positive once;fixed finite-contrast lower bound,not exact EIG. SEs condition on one training lineage and do not measure seed uncertainty.\n\n|Policy|Estimate (nats)|MCSE|\n|---|---:|---:|\n'
  for m,r in eig['methods'].items():text+=f"|{m}|{r['mean']:.6f}|{r['MCSE']:.6f}|\n"
  text+='\nPrimary paired comparisons,Holm2 p-values;displayed95%CIs are unadjusted:\n\n'+block(eig['primary'])+'\n\nInitial-adjusted training gains (separate predeclared Holm2):\n\n'+block(eig['initial_adjusted_training_gain'])+'\n\nFrozen secondary comparisons,Holm4:\n\n'+block(eig['secondary'])+'\n\nStage projection changes the initial policy despite identical starting weights. Both endpoints and gain contrasts must be inspected. Frozen reference methods are not compute matched; no cross-bank pairing or vsOED compute-matched superiority is claimed.'
 else:text+='INCOMPLETE: no complete common-bank result. Per-policy receipts,if any,remain preserved. No historical score substitution.'
 save('EIG_COMPARISON.md',text)
 save('EXPERT_COMPETENCY_ANALYSIS.md','# Expert competencies and contributions\n\n'+block(special)+'\n\nConditional contribution panel:\n\n'+block(conditional)+'\n\nThe twelve analytic response coordinates are excluded from learned-feature probes. Known semantic features are available by construction,not proof of learned useful expertise. Refitted probes use calibration histories only;legacy references have zero-padded response dimensions. E1/E3 anchors preserve functions,not their eventual use. Donor/masking effects can reflect joint distribution shift. Conditional results are grouped frozen-native-surrogate values with retained joint prefix/latent pairs,not exact per-history conditional EIG.')
 save('COMMANDER_ABLATIONS.md','# Commander and coordination\n\n'+block(commands)+'\n\nThe main trained stage control restricts both commands and coordination to stage;the design head/experts still see legitimate history. Frozen zero/stage/shuffle and uniform/stage/linear-projection tests are separate Holm3 families. The projection is not EIG trained. All changed actions generate new observations. Variation of commands alone is not success;positive EIG and mechanism effects are required.')
 save('COMPUTE_COMPARISON.md','# Computation\n\n'+block(dict(preparation=prep,training=training,evaluation=evaluation,inference_latency=latency,total_driver_seconds=(done or {}).get('seconds')))+'\n\nNative updates/episodes are matched;active architecture and exact GPU wall time need not be. Preparation is physically shared once and charged equally for opportunity accounting;ordinary v1 continuation does not use the new adapters. Distinguish real episodes from synthetic teacher observations and deterministic model query evaluations. Provider weights remain in deployment and must not be ignored when counting parameters. No complete GPU utilization/energy trace is available. All observed time and negative outcomes are preserved.')
 decision='INCOMPLETE / INCONCLUSIVE'
 positive=lambda t:any(k.startswith('Holm') and v<.05 for k,v in t.items()) and t.get('mean',0)>0
 if eig and evaluation and evaluation['status']=='COMPLETE':
  primary=all(positive(t) for t in eig['primary'].values());learned_gain=positive(eig['initial_adjusted_training_gain']['stage']);comp=(special or {}).get('competency',{}).get('designated_advantages',{});donor=(special or {}).get('expert_donor',{});mech=(special or {}).get('response_mechanism',{});mechanism=positive((commands or {}).get('commands',{}).get('stage',{})) and positive((commands or {}).get('coordination',{}).get('stage',{})) and learned_gain and all(positive(comp.get(str(k),{})) for k in [2,4]) and len(donor)==4 and all(positive(v) for v in donor.values()) and positive(mech.get('E2off',{})) and positive(mech.get('E4off',{}))
  decision='PROMISING SINGLE-LINEAGE PILOT;REPLICATION AND FURTHER IDENTIFICATION REQUIRED' if primary and mechanism else ('PARTIAL: matched-control EIG gains,but specialization/command mechanism not fully established' if primary else 'NO DEMONSTRATED IMPROVEMENT OVER BOTH MATCHED CONTROLS')
 save('NEXT_RESEARCH_DECISION.md','# Research decision\n\n'+decision+'\n\n'+block(dict(execution=done,evaluation=evaluation,primary=(eig or {}).get('primary'),initial_adjusted=(eig or {}).get('initial_adjusted_training_gain')))+'\n\nNo extra seed,training extension,architecture or transfer campaign has been launched. Non-significance is not equality. All-four usefulness,meaningful learned E2/E4 skills,history-sensitive utility beyond stage and joint mechanism effects must be separately supported. This one pilot cannot establish ICML novelty or compute-matched superiority over frozen baselines. If negative,preserve it;do not force a positive result.')
 save('RUN_INDEX.md','# HEC-MoE v2\n\n'+decision+'\n\n'+block(done)+'\n\nSee EIG_COMPARISON.md,EXPERT_COMPETENCY_ANALYSIS.md,COMMANDER_ABLATIONS.md,COMPUTE_COMPARISON.md and NEXT_RESEARCH_DECISION.md. All sources/protocol/inputs were locked before preparation. GitHub commit is recorded in PRETRAIN_MANIFEST.json. Existing checkpoints remain preserved. No Ubuntu training or final-test data.')
